        "text": "As of 2022, most DeFi services are for lending and borrowing, staking and liquidity pools. Financial services such as mortgages and insurance are also natural use cases for DeFi, but we are still at a very early stage for these. Blockchain based insurance, for example, is mostly confined to insurance for certain types of crypto deposits and investments. Before we get into these DEFI services, we must first explain the concept of a stablecoin. A stablecoin is a type of cryptocurrency whose price is typically pegged to other assets like the US Dollar or gold. The pegging mechanism is designed to achieve price stability of the stablecoin.",
